    {
      "id": "s3_negotiation",
      "text": "Acme's accounts-payable agent can release twelve hundred dollars without waking anyone up. Kindly asks for sixteen eighty up front. That counter breaks your seventy percent floor, so the policy engine turns it down. No model gets a vote. Kindly holds, their agent goes to its finance lead, and both sides wait for a person. Every message here is signed, and the signatures check out.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "page",
        "src": "https://kindly-desk-web.vercel.app/n/01a19bbf-2f56-7632-8e2d-ef89bb250d3f",
