    {
      "id": "s8_proof",
      "text": "Then there's the part I care about most. Kindly tells you what actually caused the payment. This one, the client paid on their own, ten days ahead of their usual, and Kindly says so. It doesn't take the credit. The same ledger keeps the refusal, with the rule it broke, so you can check the agent's work instead of trusting it.",
